# Without the mounted mux, the server starts, answers every route 404, and looks healthy.

title: the read surface is never mounted and the server answers from an empty mux
file: cmd/pacioli/serve.go
run: go test -count=1 -run TestServeMountsTheLedgerReadSurface -v ./cmd/pacioli/
--- before
		Handler:           ledgerhttp.Deadline(d.request, h),
--- after
		Handler:           ledgerhttp.Deadline(d.request, http.NewServeMux()),
